    "updated_at": "2021-06-04T19:19:01Z",
    "body": "Another solution would be to allow `<link rel=\"preload\" href=\"same-origin-url\" as=\"fetch\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">` to match `fetch(\"same-origin-url\", {mode: \"cors\", credentials: \"omit\"})` as part of the spec.\r\n\r\nI can't think of any real-world scenario where this wouldn't do what the website wanted it to do.",
