    "created_at": "2021-09-17T08:05:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-09-17T08:05:06Z",
    "body": "In https://github.com/WICG/credentiallessness/issues/3, @slightlyoff noted that it would be quite nice to be able to strip credentials from particular outgoing `no-cors` requests (as a more granular `COEP:credentialless`). Is something like a `credentials=omit` HTML attribute similar-enough to this bug to discuss here, or would a distinct issue be appropriate?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/921594124/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
